{"id":"noun-adjective-prepositions","lv":"b2","n":28,"cat":"prepositions","t":"Reason for, increase in, aware of: danh từ, tính từ + giới từ","en":"a reason for · an increase in · responsible for","sum":"Danh từ đi với giới từ cố định: a reason for, a demand for, an increase / a change in, a solution / an answer to, an effect / impact on, a difference between. Tính từ + giới từ (hay gặp trong công việc, học thuật): responsible for, aware of, capable of, similar to, familiar with, keen on, involved in. Sau giới từ là danh từ hoặc V-ing (capable of solving it). Increase in + lĩnh vực, of + con số; a 20% increase gọn hơn.","forms":[{"f":"danh từ + giới từ cố định","vi":"a reason for · an increase in · a solution to"},{"f":"tính từ + giới từ","vi":"responsible for · aware of · similar to"},{"f":"sau giới từ: danh từ / V-ing","vi":"capable of solving it"},{"f":"a 20% increase in sales","vi":"con số lên trước cho gọn"}],"pts":[{"id":"noun-preposition","name":"Noun + preposition","vi":"Reason for, increase in, solution to, effect on"},{"id":"adjective-preposition-b2","name":"Adjective + preposition (advanced)","vi":"Responsible for, aware of, capable of, similar to"}],"cast":{"mr-ross":{"name":{"en":"Mr Ross","vi":"thầy Ross"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"tie","top":"#6E7F92","topShade":"#5B6B7D","collar":"#F2F2F2","accent":"#4A5F8F","glasses":true,"hair":"part","hairColor":"#7A6A5A"},"x":560},"ben":{"name":{"en":"Ben","vi":"Ben"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#5A6B8C","topShade":"#4A5A78","accent":"#4A5F8F","hair":"short","hairColor":"#B8863B"},"x":1040}},"bg":"office","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Ben, there's been a big increase in sales this month.","vi":"Ben, doanh số tháng này tăng mạnh.","ipa":["bɛn","ðɛɹz","bɪn","ə","bɪɡ","ˈɪnkris","ɪn","seɪlz","ðɪs","mʌnθ"],"who":"mr-ross","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":3.326,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,1.001],[2,1.213],[3,1.376],[4,1.451],[5,1.738],[6,2.201],[7,2.363],[8,2.738],[9,2.9